title: Campus_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("campus_intro")>>
    Dex: The main quad at sunset. A stage, a statue, and a hundred people cooler than me.
    Roxy Vale: Talent Round tonight, people! Bring your talent and your partner!
    Dex: I have neither. Great start.
    <<flag campus_intro>>
<<endif>>
===

title: CampusDorm_Look
---
Dex: My dorm. Room 214 is up there somewhere, missing me.
===
title: CampusDorm_Use
---
<<go dorm_hallway from_stairs>>
===

title: LibraryDoor_Look
---
Dex: The library. Open late, for people with ambition. Or nowhere else to go.
===
title: LibraryDoor_Use
---
<<go library from_campus>>
===

title: Statue_Look
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: Our founder, Augustus Plumworth, looking slightly less cool without the shades.
<<else>>
    Dex: Founder Augustus Plumworth. Somebody put a pair of sunglasses on his head. He looks amazing.
<<endif>>
===
title: Statue_Use
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: Sorry, Augustus. You looked better in them anyway. Wait, no, I mean, you look great.
<<else>>
    Dex: The sunglasses are way out of reach. I'd need to knock them down with something.
<<endif>>
===
title: Statue_Frisbee
---
<<if flagged("statue_shades")>>
    Dex: He's got nothing left to lose.
<<else>>
    Dex: Frisbee, don't fail me now.
    Dex: Bonk! The shades flip off his head... and land right in my hand. The frisbee lands on the stage roof.
    <<take frisbee>>
    <<give sunglasses>>
    <<flag statue_shades>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Frisbee_Look
---
Dex: Somebody's frisbee, abandoned on the grass. Neon orange. Very aerodynamic.
===
title: Frisbee_Use
---
Dex: Finders keepers. Again.
<<give frisbee>>
<<flag took_frisbee>>
===

title: Kiosk_Look
---
Dex: A kiosk covered in flyers, with a campus map on the side.
===
title: Kiosk_Use
---
-> Take a Talent Round flyer <<if not flagged("took_flyer")>>
    Dex: "TALENT ROUND TONIGHT. Contestants need a talent and a partner." Subtle.
    <<give flyer>>
    <<flag took_flyer>>
-> Read the campus map
    <<jump Campus_Map>>
-> Never mind
===
title: Campus_Map
---
Dex: Where to?
-> Greek Row <<if current_act() >= 2>>
    <<go greek_row from_campus>>
-> Science Hall <<if current_act() >= 3>>
    <<go science_hall from_campus>>
-> Downtown <<if current_act() >= 4>>
    <<go downtown from_campus>>
-> Uptown <<if current_act() >= 5>>
    <<go uptown from_campus>>
-> The TV studio <<if current_act() >= 6>>
    <<go tv_studio from_campus>>
-> Stay here
    <<if current_act() < 2>>
        Dex: Everywhere else on the map can wait. Tonight, it's the Talent Round.
    <<endif>>
===

title: Stage_Look
---
Dex: The Speed Daters Live audition stage. Lights, banners, and a terrifying lack of places to hide.
===
title: Stage_Use
---
<<jump Roxy_Talk>>
===

title: Roxy_Look
---
Dex: Roxy Vale. Host of Speed Daters Live. Her smile has its own lighting crew.
===
title: Roxy_Talk
---
<<if current_act() >= 2>>
    <<jump Roxy_NextRound>>
<<elseif not flagged("met_roxy")>>
    Roxy Vale: Dex Dooley, room 214! The guy with the cowboy hat!
    Roxy Vale: Here's the deal, lover boy. Every contestant performs in the Talent Round with a partner.
    Roxy Vale: Show me someone who'll get up on this stage with you, and show me your talent.
    Dex: My talent is... uh... I'll get back to you.
    <<flag met_roxy>>
<<elseif flagged("won_ivy")>>
    <<jump Act1_TalentRound>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: No partner, no performance! Find somebody brave enough to share the spotlight.
    <<if flagged("met_ivy")>>
        Dex: Ivy writes poetry. If she could only face a crowd...
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Roxy_Token
---
<<if current_act() >= 2>>
    Roxy Vale: Keep your souvenirs, lover boy. You've already proven yourself.
<<elseif flagged("won_ivy")>>
    <<jump Act1_TalentRound>>
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Cute. Now find a partner for the Talent Round.
<<endif>>
===
title: Act1_TalentRound
---
Roxy Vale: Ladies and gentlemen, the Talent Round! Please welcome Dex Dooley and Ivy!
Ivy: (in sunglasses) "Ode to the Quiet Kid in the Back Row." By me.
Ivy: "You think I'm not listening. I am listening. I am listening so hard."
Dex: And I... do an interpretive dance. Of the poem. In a cowboy hat.
Dex: It's terrible. It's glorious. Somebody in the crowd is crying. I think it's me.
Roxy Vale: Folks, I have never seen anything like that, and I hope I never do again! They're through!
Roxy Vale: Next up: Greek Week. The Quiz Round is on Greek Row, so get to know some people, lover boy!
Ivy: That was the scariest and best thing I've ever done. Keep the bookmark. Go win this.
<<flag act1_done>>
<<act 2>>
Dex: Act One, done. Greek Row is on the campus map now.
===
title: Roxy_NextRound
---
<<if current_act() == 2>>
    Roxy Vale: The Quiz Round is on Greek Row, lover boy. The campus map will take you there.
<<elseif current_act() == 3>>
    Roxy Vale: The Dare Round is over at Science Hall. Bring your goggles!
<<elseif current_act() == 4>>
    Roxy Vale: The Date Round is Downtown. Wear something that isn't that shirt.
<<elseif current_act() == 5>>
    Roxy Vale: The Finals are Uptown! Only the best of the best, lover boy.
<<else>>
    Roxy Vale: Studio's open! The grand finale of Speed Daters Live is tonight!
<<endif>>
===

title: Item_pen_Look
---
Dex: A pen on a snapped string, liberated from the sign-up sheet.
===
title: Item_flyer_Look
---
Dex: "TALENT ROUND TONIGHT. Contestants need a talent and a partner." Lots of blank space on the back.
===
title: Combine_Pen_Flyer
---
Dex: On the back of the flyer I write: "Hi. I'm Dex. You look like someone with a secret talent. Want to be my partner tonight? Circle YES or YES."
<<take flyer>>
<<give note_for_ivy>>
<<flag wrote_note>>
===
title: Item_note_for_ivy_Look
---
Dex: My note. "Circle YES or YES." Smooth.
===
title: Item_frisbee_Look
---
Dex: A neon frisbee. Good for throwing at things you can't reach.
===
title: Item_sunglasses_Look
---
Dex: Dark shades, recently worn by a statue. Very mysterious.
===
title: Item_bookmark_Look
---
Dex: Ivy's bookmark, with a pressed daisy. She kept her place in her life story with this.
===
